## Font faces (prototype bank)

The prototype bank's feature vectors are measured from glyphs rendered from
the OFL-1.1 and Apache-2.0 font faces listed with their licences and sources
in `model/fonts.tsv`. No font file or outline data is included.

## Evaluation and training datasets (not redistributed)

Only row identifiers and hashes are committed (`bench/splits/`); no dataset
text or image is.

- MultiFinBen-EnglishOCR, Apache-2.0.
- CORD-v2, CC-BY-4.0.
- SROIE (ICDAR 2019). Its licence is not verified at source: the CC-BY-4.0
  label seen on mirrors may be the competition paper's licence, not the
  dataset's. It is not used for fitting until verified.

## Qwen3-0.6B and Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct

The optional add-on converts published weights for these two models into the
`.ocrl` format via `ocrcer-build llm-pack`. Neither model's weights, nor any
`.ocrl` file built from them, is committed to this repository — the operator
downloads and converts them locally (`ARCHITECTURE.md` section 11,
2026-09-24). This notice exists because a converted `.ocrl` file is a
derivative artifact of that upstream work and Apache License 2.0 section 4(d)
requires attribution to travel with it; `ocrcer-build llm-pack` also embeds
the model's full upstream LICENSE text directly into the `.ocrl` file's
`meta` block for the same reason.

